    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\"Breed\"\nis an \"evolutionary voxel object generator\". It employs\n3-D automata whose update rules describe how a filled voxel splits\ninto filled voxels and empty voxels. A genetic algorithm is used\nto evolve rules which create connected objects.",
